#X text 30 26 This abstraction makes it easier/faster for images with dimensions != 2^n \, by cropping and truncating to the minimum value (w or h) \, and it only outputs grey valued lists. Moreover \, it uses [iemmatrix] to transpose and reverse the list \, so it is displayed from left to right \, as if it were a waveform.;
